sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as React
    participant backend as NestJS
    participant store as Object storage
    participant database as Application database
    participant dispatcher as Outbox dispatcher
    participant ai as FastAPI
    participant queue as Redis and RQ worker
    participant model as Ollama
    participant vector as Qdrant
    browser->>backend: POST /documents through public proxy
    backend->>backend: Authorize and validate upload
    backend->>store: Store original document
    backend->>database: Commit document, job, and outbox record
    backend-->>browser: 202 with documentId and jobId
    dispatcher->>database: Read pending outbox record
    dispatcher->>ai: POST /internal/ingestion/jobs
    ai->>queue: Idempotently enqueue existing jobId
    ai-->>dispatcher: 202 accepted
    dispatcher->>database: Mark outbox record delivered
    queue->>store: Read authorized document object
    queue->>queue: Extract and chunk with source metadata
    queue->>model: Embed chunks using configured provider adapter
    model-->>queue: Vectors
    queue->>vector: SDK upsert stable chunk IDs and scope
    vector-->>queue: Index writes acknowledged
    queue->>backend: PATCH /internal/jobs/:id with successful version
    backend->>database: Mark ready and activate document version
    browser->>backend: GET /jobs/:id
    backend-->>browser: Ready or actionable failure state
